I am in the kitchen at the office.
I have a warm cup of coffee.
Two new colleagues are also in the kitchen.
A man smiles at me.
"Hello and welcome," he says.
"Thank you very much."
"My name is Maya," I answer.
"Where do you come from, Maya?" a woman asks.
"I come from Mexico," I say.
"And I am a software engineer."
The man nods.
"Welcome to the team," he says.
They are very nice.
It is a really good start.
